 oardwalk\, Pensacola Beach\, FL 32561
DESCRIPTION:Friday 12/4 · 6:30 PM\n\nDecorated boats form a lighted proces
 sion from Sabine Marina in Little Sabine Bay to the Pensacola Beach Boardw
 alk on the Santa Rosa Sound. Santa rides on the lead boat and then greets 
 families on the boardwalk by about 8:00 PM. The Santa Rosa Island Authorit
 y calendar lists the parade for December 4 at 6:30 PM.\n\nPrice: No publis
 hed price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-pb-lighted-bo
 at-parade-1204.html
