 nsacola Beach to watch Santa Claus come down the road in the annual Surfin
 g Santa Beach Parade. The parade starts at 2:00 PM from Avenida 10\, runs 
 toward Casino Beach\, and ends at the Gulfside Pavilion. The Santa Rosa Is
 land Authority calendar lists it for Sunday December 6.\n\nPrice: No publi
 shed price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-pb-surfing-s
