 beach behind the Flora-Bama on New Year's Day and walk into the Gulf toget
 her at noon\, many in costume. Anyone who fully submerges gets a free draf
 t beer and a New Year's lunch of ham\, black-eyed peas\, greens and cornbr
 ead. Wading in is optional\, and the party inside continues with live musi
 c all day.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/
 ev-flora-bama-polar-bear-dip-0101.html
